SPATIAL INTERPRETATION
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
70 km = primary historical land-use analysis.
25 km and 50 km = spatial sensitivity analyses.
The source grid is approximately 0.5 degrees, so small-buffer results must not be interpreted as fine-scale local land-cover measurements.